APPLIES TO: the contract-law rule data in this directory (rows-*.json) and the
bundles exported from it by the DocketX pack exporter.

NOT A WARRANTY. The work is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The
rule statements here are summaries of statutory text with a recorded
verification trail; they are not legal advice and they are not a substitute for
reading the cited section. Several rows exist specifically to record that we
could NOT verify something -- read the `status` and `verified` fields before
relying on any row.
